^(Function|FunctionCall|Cls|ClsInstance|FunctionService|FunctionCallService|ClsService|FunctionLogsManager|FunctionCallLogsManager)\.	a serverless Functions API, which DigitalOcean Sandboxes does not have
^(Queue|QueueService)\.	a queues API, which DigitalOcean Sandboxes does not have
^(SandboxFilesystem|SidecarFilesystem)\.	a sandbox file transfer API
\.(Open|CopyFromLocal|CopyToLocal|ListFiles|MakeDirectory|ReadBytes|ReadText|Remove|Stat|Watch|WriteBytes|WriteText)$	a sandbox file transfer API
^SandboxFile\.	a sandbox file transfer API
\.(Tunnels|CreateConnectToken)$	a ports and tunnels API
\.(GetTags|SetTags|ExperimentalSetName)$	a sandbox tags and names API
^(Volume|VolumeService)\.	a volumes API
^(CloudBucketMount|CloudBucketMountService)\.	a cloud bucket mounts API
\.(SnapshotFilesystem|SnapshotDirectory|MountImage|UnmountImage|ExperimentalGetExitSnapshot|ExperimentalFromSnapshot)$	a create-sandbox-from-snapshot API
^(Sidecar|SidecarContainer|SidecarService)	a sidecar containers API
^(Environment|EnvironmentService|EnvironmentObjectsService|EnvironmentAppsService)	an environments API
^(Logs|SandboxLogsManager)	a sandbox logs API
\.(Stats|Metrics|Info|GetCurrentStats|Instance|WithBatching|WithConcurrency|WithOptions|UpdateAutoscaler)$	a metrics and autoscaling API
\.(Stop|Info)$	an apps API
\.(ExperimentalPause|ExperimentalResume)$	a persistent sandbox pause API
^(SecretService|Secret)\.	a named secrets store API
^(ImageService|Image)\.	an image registry API
^(App|AppService|AppSandboxesManager)\.	an apps API
